{"text": "Brom wanted to fight Ichabod, but Ichabod knew that if he fought Brom, he would surely lose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So Brom played tricks on him instead, stopping up his chimney and filling the schoolhouse with smoke. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He even trained a dog to whine in a silly way, as if it were a rival singing teacher. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One autumn afternoon, a messenger arrived at the school with an invitation to a party at the Van Tassels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ichabod let the children go home an hour early and spent extra time brushing his only black suit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He borrowed an old plow horse named Gunpowder, which was thin, half blind, and still full of mischief. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the farm, the tables were covered with cakes, pies, and meats, and Ichabod ate until he was full. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he danced with Katrina, smiling happily, while Brom sat alone in a corner, sick with jealousy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later, the guests told ghost stories, and many of them were about the Headless Horseman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Brom said he had raced the Horseman to the church bridge, where the ghost vanished in a flash of fire.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "r", "o", "m", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "f", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "I", "c", "h", "a", "b", "o", "d", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "I", "c", "h", "a", "b", "o", "d", " ", "k", "n", "e", "w", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "f", " ", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "B", "r", "o", "m", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "s", "u", "r", "e", "l", "y", " ", "l", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", " ", "B", "r", "o", "m", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", "e", "d", " ", "t", "r", "i", "c", "k", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "i", "n", "s", "t", "e", "a", "d", ",", 